hey, i'm having some trouble with an iam policy for an s3 bucket. i'm trying to let a lambda function write logs to it but i keep getting an "access denied" error in the cloudwatch logs even though i added the s3:PutObject permission. here is the policy i'm using:

{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": [
        "s3:PutObject"
      ],
      "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::my-company-log-bucket/*"
    }
  ]
}

can u take a look and tell me what i'm missing? thanks

